{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111432","id":2898881794,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6syW0C","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111432","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111432.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111432.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111432","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111432/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111432/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111432/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0a584250ae76bea1e1d9447e5959e2dbea43d024","number":111432,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix LibGodot build errors on Linux.","user":{"login":"zorbathut","id":160754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut","html_url":"https://github.com/zorbathut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes LibGodot shared_library build to work properly on Linux; there was unfortunately some missing functionality in the original PR, #110863.\r\n\r\nThere's two fixes here:\r\n\r\n* The -fPIC flag needs to be introduced during the platform `configure()` step so that modules will be built with it.\r\n* The x11 and wayland platform sub-modules shouldn't use `env.Object` because it doesn't have the correct flags attached to it; instead they need to be added to `linuxbsd/SCSub`'s `common_linuxbsd` array so that add_library, add_shared_library, or add_program can do the right thing. This basically just means that we need to return a path instead of an env.Object, but we do need to wrap it with a constant path to get the right complete filename. (There might be a cleaner way to do this.)\r\n\r\nI can untangle these into separate PRs if you'd prefer them separate, this is just how I wrote 'em.\r\n\r\nTo test, run `scons library_type=shared_library` on Linux. (Shared libraries tend to be the pain point.)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creat